





4IR Medical Applications

ER-100 Clinical Trials - Life Biosciences
Investigational partial epigenetic reprogramming therapy using OSK transcription factors.
Phase 1 human testing underway, with preliminary safety and visual-function observations in three participants.

PROX-1 Gene Therapy - Celliaz Inc.
Experimental regenerative therapeutic approach targeting PROX1.
Celliaz Celliaz's pipelines are specifically designated as CLZ001 (an intravitreal anti-PROX1 antibody protein therapy) and CLZ002 (an AAV-based anti-PROX1 gene therapy).
Its retinitis pigmentosa therapy received FDA orphan-drug designation, not marketing approval.

Decoded Neurofeedback - XNef, Inc
Neurofeedback research; company-specific capabilities and current clinical validation require separate verification.

CRISPR-All, & TIGRa
Retain as provisional research references pending identification of their exact publications, mechanisms, and development status.
They should not be treated as clinically established platforms.

High Fidelity Codec Avatars - Meta
Computational reconstruction of human appearance and behavior for digital representation; not biological reproduction.

IBCI .BIDs .MAT training - OpenNeuro
Brain-interface research and neuroimaging data infrastructure.
