Synthetic Chromosomes - Synthetic Yeast Project
Synthetic yeast chromosome engineering, providing a model for genome redesign rather than a validated human chromosome assembly method.

Online-Accessible Closed-Loop Automated Laboratories - Emerald Cloud Lab
